"(a)Voluntary return and plea bargaining: – Notuhthstanding anything contained in section 15 or in any other law for the time being in force, where a holder of public OaICe or any other person, prior to the authorization of inuestigation against him, uotuntarily comes forward and offers to return the assets or gains acquired or made by him in the course, or as the consequence, of any offence under this Ordinance, the Chairman NAB may accept such offer and after determination of the amount due from such person and its deposit with the NAB discharge such person from all his liability in respect of the matter or transactionin issue: Provided that the matter is not sub judice in any court of lau> Where at any time after the authorization of investigation, before or after the commencement of the trial or during the pendency of an appeal, the accused offers to return to the NAB the assets or gains acquired or made by him in the course, or as a consequence, of any offence under this Ordinance, the Chairman, NAB, may, in his discretion, after taking into consideration the facts and circumstances of the case, accept the offer on such terms and conditions as he may consider necessary, and if the accused agrees to return to the NAB the amount determined by the Chairman, NAB, the Chairman, NAB, shall refer the case for the approval of the COUTt, or as the case may be, the Appellate Court and for the release of the accused.",(a) رضاکارانہ واپسی اور پلی بارگیننگ: - اس وقت کے لیے سیکشن 15 یا کسی دوسرے قانون میں موجود کسی بھی چیز کے باوجود، جہاں عوامی OaICe کا حامل یا کوئی دوسرا شخص، اس کے خلاف انویسٹی گیشن کی اجازت سے پہلے، خود بخود آگے آتا ہے اور اثاثوں کو واپس کرنے کی پیشکش کرتا ہے یا اس کے تحت حاصل کیے گئے اثاثے یا حاصل کردہ کسی بھی طریقے سے، اس کے تحت حاصل کیے گئے فوائد اس آرڈیننس کے تحت چیئرمین نیب ایسی پیشکش کو قبول کر سکتا ہے اور ایسے شخص کی طرف سے واجب الادا رقم کا تعین کرنے کے بعد اور نیب کے پاس جمع کرائے جانے کے بعد ایسے شخص کو معاملے یا لین دین کے سلسلے میں اس کی تمام ذ